    "chunk_text": "\ufffda s\u00e6de Petrus him, witudlice \u00feeah \u00fee ic scyle sweltan mid \u00fee ne wi\u00fesace ic \u00fein; Gelice \u00feam \u00d0a com se H\u00e6lynd mid him on \u00feone tun \u00f0e is genemned Gezemani & s\u00e6de hys leorningcnihtum, & he genam Petrum & Zebedeus twegen suna & ongann unrotsian & beon unrot. \u00d0a s\u00e6de se H\u00e6lynd heom, unrot ys min sawl o\u00fe dea\u00f0; Gebida\u00f0 her & wacia\u00f0 mid me. & \u00fea he w\u00e6s lythwon \u00feanon agan he afeoll on hys ansyne & hyne geb\u00e6d & \u00feus cw\u00e6\u00f0, F\u00e6der min, & he com to hys leorningcnihtum & he gemette hig sl\u00e6pende; & he s\u00e6de Petre, swa, ne mihton ge Wacia\u00fe & gebidda\u00f0 eow \u00fe\u00e6t ge in ne gan on costunge; Witudlice se gast is hr\u00e6d & \u00fe\u00e6t fl\u00e6sc ys Eft o\u00fere si\u00f0e he ferde & hyne geb\u00e6d & cw\u00e6\u00fe, Min F\u00e6der, gyf \u00fees calic ne m\u00e6ge gewitan buton ic & he com eft & gemette hig sl\u00e6pende; So\u00f0lice heora eagan w\u00e6ron gehefegode. & he forlet hig eft & ferde & hyne geb\u00e6d \u00feryddan si\u00f0e cwe\u00feende \u00fe\u00e6t ylce gebed. \u00dea com he to hys leorningcnihtum & s\u00e6de heom, slapa\u00f0 eallunga & resta\u00f0 eow; Nu geneal\u00e6c\u00fe seo Arisa\u00f0, uton faran; Nu geneal\u00e6c\u00f0 se \u00fee me bel\u00e6w\u00f0. \u00d0a he \u00feas \u00feing spr\u00e6c \u00fea com Iudas an of \u00feam twelfum & micel folc mid hym mid swurdum & Se \u00fee hyne bel\u00e6wde sealde heom",
